    <ul><li><a href="https://www.tercetlaw.com">Tercet Law</a> · wills and trusts</li></ul>
  </div><div class="wrap legal"><span>&copy; {year} Vault Human, LLC. Coaching is not legal, medical, financial or therapeutic advice.</span><span>Learn · Love · Live · Listen</span></div></footer>
  <div id="vh-modal" class="vh-modal" aria-hidden="true"><div class="vh-modal__bg" data-close-form></div><div class="vh-modal__card" role="dialog" aria-modal="true" aria-label="Your first key is waiting"><button class="vh-modal__x" type="button" data-close-form aria-label="Close">&times;</button><h2 class="vh-modal__title">Your first key is waiting</h2><p class="vh-modal__sub">One short teaching and one small practice, in your inbox within minutes. Your first name and email are all it takes. Then pick a time for a free 30-minute call with Russ.</p><form class="vh-cap" novalidate><label>First name<input name="firstname" type="text" autocomplete="given-name" required /></label><label>Email<input name="email" type="email" autocomplete="email" inputmode="email" required /></label><button class="btn btn-acc" type="submit">Send me the first key</button><p class="vh-cap__err" style="display:none">That didn't go through. Try again, or call <a href="tel:+18888332510">(888) 833-2510</a>.</p></form><script is:inline src="/vh-capture.js" defer></script><style is:inline>.vh-cap label{display:block;font:600 14px Inter,system-ui,sans-serif;margin:10px 0 0}.vh-cap input{display:block;width:100%;margin-top:6px;padding:12px 14px;border:1px solid #c9c4b8;border-radius:8px;font:16px Inter,system-ui,sans-serif;background:#fff;color:#1B231D}.vh-cap button{width:100%;margin-top:16px;border:0;cursor:pointer}.vh-cap__err{color:#8a2a2a;font-size:14px;margin:10px 0 0}</style><p class="vh-modal__fine">Free. One short email each morning. Unsubscribe anytime.</p></div></div>
